UPDATE feed_items
SET body = replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(body,
    'It is an outdoor, World War-style battlefield of trench lines, tunnels, and open ground, researched from real war footage.',
    'It is an outdoor battlefield of trench lines, tunnels, and open ground. In its Devlog #3, Reissad says the map draws on modern trench warfare and is not meant to recreate a specific conflict.'),
    'Trenches is built so you always know which side you are on.',
    'Reissad describes the map as divided into two environments that give it different visual identities and act as natural landmarks, making it easier to understand where you are.'),
    'The battlefield is divided into two visual halves -- one side dense, standing forest' || chr(59) || ' the other shelled, devastated ground.',
    'One is a dense forest where most of the vegetation is preserved. The other is a devastated battlefield where explosions have destroyed most of the environment.'),
    ' That contrast is a readability tool: a glance tells you your orientation and whose ground you are pushing into.',
    ''),
    'Between and beneath the two halves runs the trench system itself:',
    'The map includes:'),
    '**Minefield Borders, Not Invisible Walls**',
    '**Minefield Borders**'),
    'The map edges are minefields -- a real, in-fiction kill boundary, not an invisible wall.',
    'Reissad says the entire battlefield is surrounded by minefields, to keep the boundaries of the map realistic and dangerous.'),
    'Wander out and the mines kill you, which keeps the border consistent with the world instead of breaking immersion with a barrier. ',
    ''),
    'Down in the trench networks and tunnels it is brutal close-quarters combat -- corners, blind turns, and Bodycam' || chr(39) || 's one-or-two-shot lethality, where audio matters more than sightlines.',
    'Reissad describes Trenches as built around a mix of intense close-quarters fights inside the trench network and exposed long-distance sightlines.'),
    'Trenches was built with dedicated FPV drone and RC car lanes, and drone workshops are part of the trench line itself.',
    'Reissad says Trenches has dedicated areas designed for FPV drones and RC cars, and drone workshops are built into the trench network.'),
    'Trenches supports Hardpoint -- holding the rotating zones -- and Wingman, Bodycam' || chr(39) || 's ranked 2v2.',
    'The September 2 patch notes say Hardpoint support was added to Trenches, and that Wingman support and bombsite setup were added to compatible maps. They do not name Trenches among those maps.'),
    ' The map' || chr(39) || 's scale and multiple routes suit the objective push of Hardpoint and the tight, reset-based rounds of Wingman alike.',
    ''),
    'Destructible trees are on the ROADMAP -- announced, not shipped in this update -- so do not assume you can drop cover yet.',
    'Reissad announced destructible trees on the Trenches map in its March 2026 roadmap. We found no Reissad post saying whether they have shipped.'),
    'The studio has said the map was researched from real war footage -- drone video, satellite imagery, and veteran interviews -- which is where its layout language comes from.',
    'In its Devlog #3, Reissad says the team studied hundreds of hours of footage, such as drone recordings, satellite imagery and real trench networks, and spoke with veterans.'),
    '- Outdoor' || chr(59) || ' two visual halves (standing forest / shelled devastation) for instant orientation.',
    '- Outdoor' || chr(59) || ' two environments, a preserved dense forest and an area devastated by explosions.'),
    '- Borders are minefields -- a kill-boundary, not an invisible wall.',
    '- The battlefield is surrounded by minefields.'),
    '- Built with FPV drone and RC car lanes plus trench drone workshops' || chr(59) || ' gadgets are a map feature.',
    '- Dedicated areas for FPV drones and RC cars, plus drone workshops built into the trench network.'),
    '- Supports Hardpoint and Wingman (ranked 2v2).',
    '- Hardpoint support was added to Trenches in the September 2 patch notes.'),
    '- Destructible trees are roadmap, not shipped.',
    '- Destructible trees were announced in the March 2026 roadmap. No Reissad post found says they shipped.'),
    'Sources: Reissad Studio, "Bodycam Major Update OUT NOW! | Trench Warfare, Loadout System & Much More!" (September 2, 2026): https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441066',
    'Correction (November 24, 2026): An earlier version of this article called Trenches a World War-style battlefield. Reissad says in its Devlog #3 that the map draws on modern trench warfare and is not meant to recreate a specific conflict, so we removed that description. We also rewrote or removed claims that no Reissad source states: that the map is built so you always know which side you are on, that its edges are an in-fiction kill boundary and not an invisible wall, that audio matters more than sightlines in the trenches, that its drone and RC areas are lanes, that Trenches supports Wingman as a ranked mode, and that destructible trees had not shipped. We also removed a sentence calling the two areas a readability tool and a sentence saying the map suits Hardpoint and Wingman alike, and shortened the minefield heading. The rewritten sentences now follow what Reissad says in its Devlog #3, its September 2 patch notes and its March 2026 roadmap. Other descriptive sentences in this article, such as how the map plays, are our own reading and were not changed in this correction.' || chr(13) || chr(10) || chr(13) || chr(10) || 'Sources: Reissad Studio, "Bodycam Major Update OUT NOW! | Trench Warfare, Loadout System & Much More!" (September 2, 2026): https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441066' || chr(59) || ' Reissad Studio, "Bodycam Devlog Part [3/4] : Trenches | V0.8 Locked & Loaded" (August 25, 2026): https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678435' || chr(59) || ' Reissad Studio, Devlog #3: Trenches, video (August 25, 2026): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hRDSX1RLtnw' || chr(59) || ' Reissad Studio, "BODYCAM 2026 ROADMAP PART 1" (March 6, 2026): https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059925643'),
    updated_at = now()
WHERE id = '08e34d80-b70d-4a88-905d-12259e17e18a'
  AND md5(body) = 'a366bca03b4d8645e1392a2c73407772'
  AND is_published = true
  AND body NOT LIKE '%Correction (November 24, 2026)%';
